WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.000
Ryu jumps toward Manon before the anti-air.

2
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.470
Back medium kick intercepts the jump.

3
00:00:01.470 --> 00:00:02.390
The medium-kick target follow-up catches the airborne Ryu.

4
00:00:02.390 --> 00:00:03.350
OD Dégagé extends the juggle.

5
00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:05.350
Light Renversé catches Ryu after the OD extension.

6
00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:06.150
The hit-grab finish raises Manon from one medal to two.
